:"二十四年春正月〖1〗，仁屠宛，斩音。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o049a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8a052498f4fbd858ba0b","layer":"original","quote":"曹公自长安举众南征。先主遥策之曰：“曹公虽来，无能为也；我必有汉川矣〖14〗！”及曹公至，先主敛众拒险，终不交锋；积月不拔，亡者日多。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
